WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.700
ChatGPT can now make Instagram carousels
without ever touching a design tool,

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.200
just by using ChatGPT.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.500
I used it for three of my posts,
and it got hundreds of thousands of views.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.600
Just go to ChatGPT,
paste in this carousel master prompt,

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.600
type in your topic, and it will generate
the entire thing as an interactive preview

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.900
that you can click through. And the best part
is that every slide is branded to your guidelines.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:28.600
If you ever want to change something,
you can export it directly into Canva,

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.100
or just ask ChatGPT to do it.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.500
You can make a full month’s worth of carousels
in just a few minutes by doing this.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:40.800
If you want this exact prompt, follow me
and comment “CAROUSEL,” and I’ll send it over.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.733
You can also use it for your own product,
your business, or your personal brand.
